<title>TURKEY: Turkey sets 2-year inflation-indexed bond auction.</title>
<headline>Turkey sets 2-year inflation-indexed bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish central bank said the Treasury would auction on Tuesday two-year, inflation indexed, three-month coupon payment bonds after it sold 55.27 trillion lira worth two-year bonds on May 13.</p>
<p>The treasury has 288.2 trillion lira of t-bill redemption on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    Maturity    : June 4, 1999</p>
<p>    Amount	: -</p>
<p>    Coupon	: -</p>
<p>Auction date: June 3, 1997</p>
<p>Value date  : June 4, 1997</p>
<p>-- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-275 08 75</p>
